#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:7
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "相机"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:9
msgid ""
"A :class:`~sensors.Camera` defines what to capture: camera pose, projection,"
" resolution, sampling period, and output data types. A renderer defines how "
"those images are produced. Keeping these responsibilities separate lets one "
"camera configuration work with different physics and rendering backends."
msgstr ""
":class:`~sensors.Camera` "
"定义采集内容：相机位姿、投影方式、分辨率、采样周期和输出数据类型。渲染器定义这些图像如何生成。将两者的职责分开，同一相机配置就可以用于不同的物理和渲染后端。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:14
msgid ""
"Camera data is expensive compared with low-dimensional state. Isaac Lab "
"therefore batches the camera copies from cloned environments into tiled "
"render passes and exposes the de-tiled result as one device-resident buffer "
"per requested output."
msgstr ""
"与低维状态相比，相机数据的开销较大。因此，Isaac Lab "
"将克隆环境中的相机副本合并到平铺渲染批次中，并为每种请求的输出提供一个驻留在设备上的缓冲区，保存拆分平铺图像后的结果。"

