#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:70
msgid ""
"With OVRTX, separate camera sensors share the scene and renderer when their "
"renderer configurations match, while each sensor owns a separate tiled "
"render product. For example, ``env_0/head_camera`` and ``env_1/head_camera``"
" form one product, while ``env_0/wrist_camera`` and ``env_1/wrist_camera`` "
"form another. The sensors can use different resolutions and output types, "
"and their poses update independently. Define all camera prims before "
"initializing the simulation so they are included in the scene exported to "
"OVRTX."
msgstr ""
"使用 OVRTX 时，如果不同相机传感器的渲染器配置相同，它们会共享场景和渲染器，但各传感器分别拥有自己的平铺渲染产品。例如， "
"``env_0/head_camera`` 和 ``env_1/head_camera`` 构成一个产品， ``env_0/wrist_camera``"
" 和 ``env_1/wrist_camera`` 则构成另一个。各传感器可以使用不同的分辨率和输出类型，位姿也独立更新。请在初始化仿真前定义所有相机 "
"prim，确保它们包含在导出到 OVRTX 的场景中。"

