"The setting is per camera. Cameras with renderer-default and solid "
"backgrounds can coexist in one scene."
msgstr "该设置按相机生效。使用渲染器默认背景的相机和使用纯色背景的相机可以共存于同一场景。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:296
msgid "Post-render image signal processing"
msgstr "渲染后的图像信号处理"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:298
msgid ""
":attr:`~sensors.CameraCfg.isp_cfg` optionally applies an image signal "
"processing (ISP) pass to the renderer's scene-linear HDR output. The shipped"
" implementation is PPISP (Physically Plausible Image Signal Processing), "
"which applies responsivity, exposure, vignetting, color correction, and a "
"camera response function before writing ``rgb`` or ``rgba``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sensors.CameraCfg.isp_cfg` 可选择对渲染器的场景线性 HDR 输出执行图像信号处理（ISP）。随附实现为 "
"PPISP（Physically Plausible Image Signal Processing，物理合理的图像信号处理），它在写入 ``rgb``"
" 或 ``rgba`` 前应用响应度、曝光、渐晕、颜色校正和相机响应函数。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:303
msgid "The field accepts:"
msgstr "该字段接受："

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:305
msgid "``None`` to disable post-render ISP."
msgstr "``None`` ：禁用渲染后的 ISP。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:306
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_ppisp.PpispCfg` for explicit coefficients or coefficients "
"imported from a USD camera."
msgstr ":class:`~isaaclab_ppisp.PpispCfg` ：使用显式系数，或从 USD 相机导入的系数。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:308
msgid ""
":class:`~sensors.CameraISPMode` to discover ``ppisp:*`` attributes on a "
"camera prim."
msgstr ":class:`~sensors.CameraISPMode` ：查找相机 prim 上的 ``ppisp:*`` 属性。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:320
msgid ""
"``AUTO_CAMERA`` checks the first matched camera prim. ``AUTO_ANY`` falls "
"back to the first PPISP camera anywhere on the stage. Discovery happens once"
" during camera construction."
msgstr ""
"``AUTO_CAMERA`` 检查第一个匹配的相机 prim。 ``AUTO_ANY`` 在未找到时，会回退到舞台上任意位置的第一个 PPISP "
"相机。查找仅在构造相机时执行一次。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:323
msgid ""
"PPISP is composed by Isaac RTX, OVRTX, and Newton Warp. It requires ``rgb`` "
"or ``rgba`` output. A static configuration is shared by all cloned views in "
"one camera batch; controller weights may predict per-view exposure and color"
" parameters, while the remaining coefficients stay shared. ISP configuration"
" and discovered USD attributes are fixed for the camera lifetime."
msgstr ""
"Isaac RTX、OVRTX 和 Newton Warp 都可集成 PPISP。它要求输出包含 ``rgb`` 或 ``rgba`` "
"。同一相机批次中所有克隆视图共享静态配置；控制器权重可以预测各视图的曝光和颜色参数，其余系数仍然共享。ISP 配置和查找到的 USD "
"属性在相机的整个生命周期内保持固定。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:330
msgid ""
"With Isaac RTX and OVRTX, enabling ``isp_cfg`` makes PPISP the ISP "
"authority. The renderer disables RTX auto-exposure, authors neutral "
"``exposure:*`` values, and applies the ``OmniRtxCameraAutoExposureAPI_1`` "
"and ``OmniRtxCameraExposureAPI_1`` schemas on every matched camera prim so "
"RTX does not process the image a second time. Do not combine ``isp_cfg`` "
"with separately authored RTX exposure or tonemapping settings. When "
"``isp_cfg`` is ``None``, the renderer leaves authored camera exposure "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"使用 Isaac RTX 和 OVRTX 时，启用 ``isp_cfg`` 后由 PPISP 统一负责 ISP。渲染器会禁用 RTX 自动曝光，将 "
"``exposure:*`` 属性设置为中性值，并在每个匹配的相机 prim 上应用 "
"``OmniRtxCameraAutoExposureAPI_1`` 和 ``OmniRtxCameraExposureAPI_1`` 模式，避免 "
"RTX 对图像重复处理。请勿将 ``isp_cfg`` 与另行设置的 RTX 曝光或色调映射配置混用。 ``isp_cfg`` 为 ``None`` "
"时，渲染器不会改变相机上已有的曝光设置。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:337
msgid "Run the ``ppisp-camera`` example for a complete PPISP workflow:"
msgstr "运行 ``ppisp-camera`` 示例可体验完整的 PPISP 工作流程："

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:358
msgid ""
"Images are written to ``output/ppisp_camera`` in the current working "
"directory by default. Pass ``--output_dir <path>`` to choose another "
"location."
msgstr ""
"图像默认写入当前工作目录下的 ``output/ppisp_camera`` 。传入 ``--output_dir <path>`` 可指定其他位置。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:362
msgid "Performance and validation"
msgstr "性能与验证"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:364
msgid ""
"Image memory and rendering cost scale with the number of environments, "
"resolution, channel count, and requested outputs. Start camera-based tasks "
"with a small environment count, verify shapes and renderer support, and then"
" scale while monitoring GPU memory. Avoid requesting buffers that the task "
"does not consume."
msgstr ""
"图像内存占用和渲染开销随环境数量、分辨率、通道数及请求的输出数量增长。开始运行基于相机的任务时，先使用少量环境，检查数据形状和渲染器支持情况，再逐步扩大规模，同时监控显存占用。避免请求任务不使用的缓冲区。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/camera.rst:369
msgid ""
"Tiled rendering batches the cloned views into shared render passes, but it "
"does not remove the memory cost of the de-tiled outputs or downstream vision"
" models. The camera follows the shared sensor ``update_period`` contract; "
"choose a period that matches the observation cadence instead of rendering at"
" every physics step by default."
msgstr ""
"平铺渲染将克隆视图合并到共享渲染批次中，但无法消除拆分后的输出或下游视觉模型的内存开销。相机遵循传感器通用的 ``update_period`` "
"约定；应根据观测频率选择周期，而不是默认在每个物理步渲染。"

